00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:22.140
Hello?

00:00:27.770 --> 00:00:30.150
...lp... me...

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:31.570
Huh?

00:00:34.950 --> 00:00:36.820
Help me...

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:44.870
What's wrong?

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.830
The cat trail...

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:52.340
On the cat trail...
I fell into the river...

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:56.470
It's so cold... I can't get out...

00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.350
Hang in there just a little longer.

00:01:05.350 --> 00:01:08.270
My Super Cub is coming to the rescue.

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:30.690
Koguma-<i>san</i>...

00:02:30.690 --> 00:02:32.360
Are you okay?

00:02:50.250 --> 00:02:52.130
You alive?

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.630
Wake up.

00:02:57.590 --> 00:03:03.260
Koguma-<i>san</i>, you really did
come and save me...

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:06.560
I'm cold...

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:13.940
I can't climb out of here
while carrying you.

00:03:13.940 --> 00:03:17.030
I'll help, but you'll need
to pull yourself up.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.690
Mm-hmm...

00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:40.090
F-Forgive me...

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:43.800
You're still lighter than my Cub, I think.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:48.850
Um, are the police or an
ambulance coming...?

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.520
I didn't call them.

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:55.810
I live close by, so you should take
a hot bath and change your clothes.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.230
After that, I'll take you home.

00:04:14.000 --> 00:04:15.460
What's up?

00:04:17.920 --> 00:04:20.880
Huh?! How's Shii-<i>chan</i>? Is she okay?

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:22.510
She's all right.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:31.640
Mm-hmm. Yeah. See to it, okay?

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:38.940
You don't need fire and rescue, but I did
call someone driving the same color.

00:04:56.420 --> 00:04:57.750
Huh?

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.180
Um, what are you...?

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:16.560
Koguma-<i>san</i>, you wouldn't...

00:05:16.560 --> 00:05:20.610
You weigh less than a full stack of
the morning edition being delivered.

00:05:20.610 --> 00:05:22.190
Here we go.

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:19.140
Wait just a minute.

00:07:34.950 --> 00:07:36.450
Get undressed.

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:44.210
Oh, forgive me--

00:07:44.210 --> 00:07:45.590
It's okay.

00:07:58.140 --> 00:08:00.600
I'm going to wash your clothes.

00:08:00.600 --> 00:08:04.400
All I have is that shampoo and body soap.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:08.570
Um, thank you... very much.

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.780
You can thank the Cub.

00:08:40.850 --> 00:08:42.810
This came out fine.

00:08:44.730 --> 00:08:46.310
But...

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:02.410
She wants to be like the two of you.

00:09:03.960 --> 00:09:05.210
Like us?

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.460
Yes.

00:09:06.460 --> 00:09:09.210
She seems to be riding
her bicycle around a lot more,

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:11.800
even when she's not shopping.

00:09:11.800 --> 00:09:16.130
Almost as if she's trying
to catch up to you two.

00:09:18.010 --> 00:09:22.350
I'm the one who pushed the
Alex Moulton she's riding on her,

00:09:22.350 --> 00:09:25.440
and now that she finally seems
to have taken a liking to it,

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.150
I kind of feel happy about it.

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:41.080
Episode 11

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:41.080
Super Cub

00:09:36.030 --> 00:09:41.080
A Distant Spring

00:09:51.800 --> 00:09:53.460
Koguma-<i>san</i>...

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:58.220
U-Um...

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.340
Is the bath available?

00:09:59.340 --> 00:10:01.100
Reiko-<i>chan</i>?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.560
Bath time, bath time!

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:07.100
Um...

00:10:09.310 --> 00:10:13.280
That's okay! Don't worry about these!

00:10:13.280 --> 00:10:15.900
You want to go home in wet panties?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:22.830
I'll do it myself...

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:35.590
This room is dry in the winter,
so they'll be dry by tomorrow morning.

00:10:35.590 --> 00:10:36.970
Okay.

00:10:48.980 --> 00:10:51.060
Um, I really ought to
do something to help--

00:10:51.060 --> 00:10:52.770
It's just about done already.

00:11:01.950 --> 00:11:04.450
Okay, dig in.

00:11:04.450 --> 00:11:06.910
Ah, that smells great.

00:11:06.910 --> 00:11:08.540
Whoa, Reiko-<i>chan</i>!

00:11:08.540 --> 00:11:10.290
Oh, curry udon!

00:11:10.290 --> 00:11:13.420
Well, I'd only get my
clothes dirty, so I'll just--

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:18.170
They're maintenance coveralls;
they're <i>supposed </i>to get dirty.

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:20.550
Oh!

00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:21.930
Let's eat.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.810
Thank you for this food.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.080
Delicious!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:00.720
Oh, you have hard-boiled eggs!

00:12:09.930 --> 00:12:11.690
Excuse me...

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:16.570
Well, after all, Shii-<i>chan</i>
needs her nutrition, right?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:18.570
There, your topping.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:20.940
Th-Thank you very much.

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:22.740
You're very welcome!

00:12:22.740 --> 00:12:24.490
<i>You </i>have more than
enough nutrition, right?

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:28.910
Huh? I think I've done
enough to earn this.

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:40.170
Here.

00:13:07.570 --> 00:13:10.410
Oh, I'll take care of this!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.570
Shii-<i>chan</i>...

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:48.200
Yes?

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:51.580
What is it?

00:13:51.580 --> 00:13:55.120
Your Moulton... has had it.

00:14:53.560 --> 00:14:55.770
I just...

00:14:55.770 --> 00:15:01.940
I just hate winter.
Why does it have to be this cold?

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:13.580
I'm begging you, Koguma-<i>san</i>...
please make it spring for me, right now.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:19.120
Please save me again with your Super Cub.

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:24.090
Please take this cold, dark winter...

00:15:24.090 --> 00:15:29.590
...and send it...
send it away somewhere...

00:15:32.640 --> 00:15:35.390
I'm begging you...

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.720
I'm begging you...

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:41.060
I'm begging...

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.980
That's...

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:51.660
...not something my Cub... can do.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:08.380
Thank you very much.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:12.090
Thank you so very, very much.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:14.930
Oh, that's okay.

00:16:14.930 --> 00:16:18.020
Here, a one-year free pass for our coffee.

00:16:18.020 --> 00:16:20.270
Both of you, please use it
as much as you like.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:23.060
Th-Thank you very much.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:26.150
Does that mean we can drink coffee
here for free for a year?

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:26.880
Yes.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:27.820
Oh, yeah?

00:16:27.820 --> 00:16:30.280
Dear, sandwiches, too.

00:16:30.280 --> 00:16:34.070
Ah, of course. Can I have that back?

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:40.790
There. All sandwiches
and bread items are free.

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:40.390
All bread items free

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.040
Whoo!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.340
Can we start using it today?

00:16:46.340 --> 00:16:47.670
Of course!

00:16:47.670 --> 00:16:51.420
Hooray! What am I going to get?

00:16:54.800 --> 00:16:58.970
Just as the frigid air that blankets
the town of Hokuto...

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:03.270
...and the chill winds of the
Southern Alps remain unyielding,

00:17:03.270 --> 00:17:05.690
our uneventful days picked up
again the next day,

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:08.860
and showed no signs of changing.

00:17:08.860 --> 00:17:11.150
Good morning!

00:17:12.240 --> 00:17:13.860
Good morning.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:21.830
There was an old granny bike that
no one at her home rode anymore.

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:27.670
This city cycle, with wheels larger
than her Moulton road racer's,

00:17:27.670 --> 00:17:29.800
was not a good fit for her.

00:17:33.090 --> 00:17:39.350
We traveled along our usual roads--us on
our Cubs, and her on her granny bike.

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:43.930
Our days were spent just coming to school,
then going home again.

00:17:46.600 --> 00:17:50.770
Our Cubs were outfitted
for the cold weather,

00:17:50.770 --> 00:17:56.490
so we could deal with the winter cold
and the snow that sometimes fell.

00:17:56.490 --> 00:17:58.990
There weren't really
any other issues to solve,

00:17:58.990 --> 00:18:00.990
nor anything else to buy.

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:06.210
There were no more
opponents for us to fight.

00:18:08.130 --> 00:18:14.210
The project to turn the eat-in space into
an Italian bar had been put on hold.

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:17.220
I asked her when she would start it again,

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:19.530
and she just said, "In a little while,"

00:18:18.140 --> 00:18:20.600
Thank you very much!

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:23.180
with a noncommittal smile.

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:39.530
The Kagoshima Weather Observatory's
<i>yoshino </i>cherry blossoms

00:18:39.530 --> 00:18:42.280
have begun to bloom.

00:18:42.280 --> 00:18:44.240
They have started nine days
earlier than the average,

00:18:44.240 --> 00:18:46.460
but four days later than--

00:18:46.460 --> 00:18:49.460
Year

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:52.460
Final Exam

00:18:49.460 --> 00:18:52.460
English

00:19:08.560 --> 00:19:11.690
Final exams are over at last!

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:17.030
Vacation starts tomorrow.
Do you have any plans?

00:19:17.030 --> 00:19:19.360
Not really.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:20.780
Reiko-<i>chan</i>, how about you?

00:19:20.780 --> 00:19:24.950
Nah. Well, ride my Cub, I guess.

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:26.750
Excuse me...

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:28.460
Coming!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:31.630
Please take your time, okay?

00:19:31.630 --> 00:19:33.670
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:42.970
Thank you for the coffee.

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.350
Um...

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:50.940
Please come by again, okay?

00:19:52.190 --> 00:19:52.750
Mm-hmm.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.360
Of course.

00:19:59.740 --> 00:20:02.990
I sure hope spring gets here soon.

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:08.950
Once spring is here, all the cherry
blossoms around will bloom.

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:14.500
They said on the news that
they're already out in Kagoshima.

00:20:23.010 --> 00:20:24.720
Want to go see?

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.050
Huh?

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:30.180
Go see the cherry blossoms.

00:20:38.190 --> 00:20:42.360
I don't see... how we could...

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:55.710
Maybe we ought to go...

00:20:55.710 --> 00:20:57.090
Huh?

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.640
Go see the cherry blossoms.

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.560
Koguma-<i>san</i>, could I...?

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:16.310
Could I go with you, too, please?

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:30.870
I was told that she wanted to be like us,
and that she was trying to catch up to us.

00:21:30.870 --> 00:21:35.120
But I was the one who was chasing her.

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:41.000
I wonder if she even remembers...

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:45.430
...how on that day, she passed me up.

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:50.180
And it wasn't just that one time.

00:21:50.180 --> 00:21:55.100
She always looks forward to what's
ahead of her, and runs after it.

00:21:56.350 --> 00:22:00.770
To me, she's the girl...

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:11.990
...who's responsible for
introducing me to my Cub,

00:22:11.990 --> 00:22:14.660
and whom I met through my Cub.

00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:20.880
Where I once had nothing
in my life, now...

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:26.630
As it stands now, this winter
is killing the three of us.

00:22:28.640 --> 00:22:34.140
So... let's all three of us
escape from winter.

00:22:34.140 --> 00:22:36.980
Let's go and snatch spring on our Cubs.

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:15.970
Episode 12

00:24:10.990 --> 00:24:15.970
Super Cub

00:24:12.610 --> 00:24:15.950
Episode 12: "Super Cub."
